{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_057_1000_012mam", "source_sha256": "32c5f01f21650273b831f0b50190f3900dada7fcd4b624552519c5cea15037bd", "ja": "フッ……見つけてしまった。\n冷蔵庫に、みさきちがくれた\nヒミツのオヤツがあるのを……。", "zh": "呵……被我发现了。\n冰箱里有美咲给的\n秘密零食……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_057_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "0533835429e7f44dc8d7c941cf54a7af61a21691694f4ed0b61a5bf2b19d6e00", "ja": "んっふっふ～♪　ちっちゃい\nケーキがいっぱいだったよね！\nさーて、どれから食べよっかな♪", "zh": "嗯哼哼～♪ 里面有好多\n小蛋糕呢！\n那么～先吃哪个好呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_057_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "429549ade6fc943f7ccf396bfab2d931ddbb742b3fdefac896cdeb52efeabbc3", "ja": "あれ、でも亜美、\nあのケーキ、人数分あったっけ？", "zh": "咦，不过真美，那些蛋糕够大家分吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_057_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "232af17e20edcb7ff0f694c9d5f040509018946c6bee108e5364b4ec41b2bee6", "ja": "あれ、どうだっけ？　たしか、\nえ～ひいふうみい……たくさん。\nうあうあ、わかんないよ～！", "zh": "哎呀，是怎样的来着？记得好像是，\n唔～一二三……好多呢。\n哇啊哇啊，搞不懂啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_057_1004_012mam", "source_sha256": "a8127a64674566c99bd4966a6033b76be99cb498677583bfd395c153bb4970be", "ja": "とりあえず、チーズケーキは\n兄ちゃん用に取っとこうか。", "zh": "总之，芝士蛋糕就给哥哥留着吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_057_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_057_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "c2c29586bf103070d488dc0882d60a930deee9bd16ccb5084915834ad0af789a", "ja": "え、なんでチーズケーキ？\n兄ちゃんは、なんか\nショートケーキっぽくない？", "zh": "诶，为什么是芝士蛋糕？\n哥哥不是更像水果蛋糕吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
